flowchart TB
  accTitle: Two loops for self-programmable hardware
  accDescr: An active sensor pipeline supplies application results and telemetry. A slower agent proposes a design, tools compile it, and independent validation decides whether to accept it. A deployment controller installs compatible accepted candidates and can restore a known-good image.
  subgraph RUN["APPLICATION"]
    S["Sensor stream"] --> F["Active FPGA pipeline"]
    F --> O["Results + telemetry"]
  end
  O -. "evidence" .-> A
  subgraph DESIGN["DESIGN"]
    A["Propose a change"] --> T["Compile + inspect"]
    T --> V["Validate independently"]
    V -. "reject / revise" .-> A
  end
  V -->|"accept"| D["Deploy / recover"]
  D -->|"activate"| F
  classDef active fill:#e8f3f4,stroke:#26727c,color:#163c43,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef design fill:#edf0fb,stroke:#596baf,color:#253266,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef control fill:#fff2dc,stroke:#a46920,color:#67400f,stroke-width:1.5px
  class S,F,O active
  class A,T,V design
  class D control
  style RUN fill:#f7fbfb,stroke:#87afb5,color:#163c43
  style DESIGN fill:#f8f9fe,stroke:#9aa7ce,color:#253266
